-- Seed migration: TrackDash's first real catalog dataset.
--
-- NOT throwaway/disposable demo data: this is the same curated set of
-- real, recognizable Tamiya Mini 4WD models previously hardcoded only in
-- lib/data/products.ts, now also persisted as real rows so that
-- collection_items/wishlist_items (which have NOT NULL foreign keys into
-- products/product_releases) have real catalog rows to reference.
--
-- Generated FROM lib/data/products.ts (not hand-written) by
-- scripts/generate-catalog-seed.mjs, so the ids below are byte-for-byte
-- identical to the ones the app computes at runtime via
-- lib/data/stable-id.ts's stableUuid() -- both are derived from the exact
-- same natural keys (item numbers, release indices). Re-running the
-- generator after adding new SEEDS entries only ever produces new rows;
-- it never changes an id that already exists.
--
-- Every INSERT is ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING, so this migration is safe
-- to re-run (e.g. against a project that already has these rows).

on conflict (id) do nothing;

on conflict (id) do nothing;

on conflict (id) do nothing;

on conflict (id) do nothing;
